@startuml agentic-product-operations-boundary
title Agentic Product / Agentic Operations Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §5 + §17

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Agentic Operations" as AO

AP --> AO : may depend on / use

note right
  Per ADR-ES-016 §5 + APROD-NEG-005:
  - Agentic Operations represents the operating environment
  - Agentic Operations is NOT a Product subtype
  - Agentic Product is NOT Agentic Operations
end note

@enduml
